ttl 86400
force gravity
url https://mrdata.usgs.gov/mrds/geo-mrds.php?format=json&south=-90&north=90&west=-180&east=180&dep_type=PRODUCER&commod=&country=
map features
lat_key geometry.coordinates.1
lon_key geometry.coordinates.0
field properties.site_name site_name
field properties.commod1 primary_commodity
field properties.oper_type operation_type
field properties.country country
field properties.state state_province

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [62] ESA Swarm — Magnetfeld-Satelliten (INTERMAGNET + ESA REST)
